msgid ""
"  codecs web   Web video in Firefox only. Replaces Fedora's empty OpenH264 stand-in with\n"
"               Cisco's OpenH264 from Fedora's Cisco repository, under Cisco's own H.264\n"
"               patent license.\n"
"  codecs full  Everything. Replaces Fedora's free ffmpeg libraries with the full ffmpeg,\n"
"               x264 and x265 from RPM Fusion, the source standard Fedora uses."
msgstr ""
"  codecs web   Vidèo sul web sonque dins Firefox. Remplaça lo substitut void d’OpenH264 de Fedora per\n"
"               l’OpenH264 de Cisco, del depaus Cisco de Fedora, jos la licéncia de brevet H.264\n"
"               pròpria de Cisco.\n"
"  codecs full  Tot. Remplaça las bibliotècas ffmpeg liuras de Fedora per ffmpeg complet,\n"
"               x264 e x265 de RPM Fusion, la font qu’utiliza lo Fedora estandard."

msgid ""
"  evenkeel-os-packages install [FILE]   install an .rpm or .deb (no FILE: pick one from Downloads)\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages remove           remove an app installed this way\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages check FILE       say what a package needs, without installing anything\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages repair           set a broken app box up again (--if-broken: only if one does not work)\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages login            choose box apps that start when you log in\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages windows FILE     a Windows .exe or .msi: offer a Linux app that does its job\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages check-windows FILE  say what a Windows file is and what would be offered, without any window\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages zoom LINK        a Zoom \"open the app\" link: open the meeting in Zoom's web version, in Chrome\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages vpn [NAME]       add a VPN from its company's own download source (mullvad, proton, ivpn,\n"
"                                        nordvpn; no NAME: pick one)"
msgstr ""
"  evenkeel-os-packages install [FILE]   installar un .rpm o un .deb (sens FILE: ne causir un dins Downloads)\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages remove           suprimir una aplicacion installada d’aquesta manièra\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages check FILE       indicar çò que demanda un paquet, sens res installar\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages repair           tornar configurar una bóstia d’aplicacions avariada (--if-broken: sonque se una fonciona pas)\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages login            causir las aplicacions de bóstia que se lançan quand vos connectatz\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages windows FILE     un .exe o .msi de Windows: prepausar una aplicacion Linux que fa la meteissa causa\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages check-windows FILE  indicar çò qu’es un fichièr Windows e çò que seriá prepausat, sens cap de fenèstra\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages zoom LINK        un ligam Zoom « dobrir l’aplicacion »: dobrir la reünion dins la version web de Zoom, dins Chrome\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages vpn [NAME]       apondre un VPN a partir de la font de telecargament de son editor (mullvad, proton, ivpn,\n"
"                                        nordvpn; sens NAME: ne causir un)"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\"{name}\" comes with Fedora. The trusted list is rebuilt from Fedora's "
"current list at every start, so an update replaces or drops it; keep "
"automatic updates on. If this alert stays after updating and restarting, tell"
" your helper."
msgstr ""
"« {name} » ven amb Fedora. La lista de confiança es reconstruida a partir de "
"la lista actuala de Fedora a cada aviada, doncas una mesa a jorn lo remplaça "
"o lo suprimís; daissatz las mesas a jorn automaticas activadas. Se aquesta "
"alèrta demòra aprèp la mesa a jorn e la reaviada, avisatz la persona que vos "
"ajuda."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\"{name}\" has expired, but its file ({file}) holds {n} certificate, and "
"removing it would remove them all, the good ones too. Tell your helper."
msgid_plural ""
"\"{name}\" has expired, but its file ({file}) holds {n} certificates, and "
"removing it would remove them all, the good ones too. Tell your helper."
msgstr[0] ""
"« {name} » a expirat, mas son fichièr ({file}) conten {n} certificat, e lo "
"suprimir los suprimiriá totes, los bons tanben. Avisatz la persona que vos "
"ajuda."
msgstr[1] ""
"« {name} » a expirat, mas son fichièr ({file}) conten {n} certificats, e lo "
"suprimir los suprimiriá totes, los bons tanben. Avisatz la persona que vos "
"ajuda."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\"{name}\" has expired. It was added in a way Wheelhouse can't remove; tell "
"your helper."
msgstr ""
"« {name} » a expirat. Es estat apondut d’una manièra que Wheelhouse pòt pas "
"suprimir; avisatz la persona que vos ajuda."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "\"{name}\" is removed and no longer trusted."
msgstr "« {name} » es suprimit e es pas pus de confiança."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\"{name}\" was added to this computer and expired on {date}. An expired "
"certificate shouldn't be relied on. Remove it if you no longer need it; if "
"you do, ask whoever gave it to you for a new one. Removing it needs your "
"password."
msgstr ""
"« {name} » es estat apondut a aqueste ordenador e a expirat lo {date}. Cal "
"pas se fisar d’un certificat expirat. Suprimissètz-lo se n’avètz pas pus "
"besonh; se n’avètz encara besonh, demandatz-ne un novèl a la persona que vos "
"l’a donat. Per lo suprimir, cal vòstre senhal."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\"{name}\" was added to this computer and expires on {date}. Ask whoever gave"
" it to you for a new one before then."
msgstr ""
"« {name} » es estat apondut a aqueste ordenador e expira lo {date}. "
"Demandatz-ne un novèl a la persona que vos l’a donat abans aquela data."

#. Translators: a weekday and date ("Thursday, November 26"). Uses strftime codes.
msgid "%A, %B %-d"
msgstr "%A %-d %B"

#. Translators: a date: month and day ("November 26"). Uses strftime codes.
msgid "%B %-d"
msgstr "%-d %B"

#. Translators: a date and a 12-hour time ("November 26, 7:02 PM"). Uses strftime codes.
msgid "%B %-d, %-I:%M %p"
msgstr "%-d %B, %-Ih%M %p"

#. Translators: a date and a 24-hour time ("November 26, 19:02"). Uses strftime codes.
msgid "%B %-d, %H:%M"
msgstr "%-d %B, %Hh%M"

msgid "(nothing was printed)"
msgstr "(cap de sortida)"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "- and {n} more"
msgid_plural "- and {n} more"
msgstr[0] "- e {n} autre"
msgstr[1] "- e {n} autres"

msgid ""
"1.00 is the normal size. Large text in Settings, Accessibility sets 1.25."
msgstr ""
"1,00 es la talha normala. Grand tèxte dins Paramètres, Accessibilitat, la met"
" a 1,25."

msgid "12 hour"
msgstr "12 oras"

msgid "24 hour"
msgstr "24 oras"

msgid ""
"A .deb driver can't be installed. The window says how to get the .rpm from "
"the maker."
msgstr ""
"Se pòt pas installar un pilòt .deb. La fenèstra explica cossí obténer lo .rpm"
" del fabricant."

msgid "A USB mouse works."
msgstr "Una mirga USB fonciona."

msgid "A USB webcam works."
msgstr "Una webcam USB fonciona."

msgid "A VPN"
msgstr "Un VPN"

msgid "A Windows program you downloaded (.exe or .msi)"
msgstr "Un programa Windows qu’avètz telecargat (.exe o .msi)"

msgid "A background service fails"
msgstr "Un servici en rèireplan fonciona pas"

msgid ""
"A background service that runs on this computer fails to start (the mobile "
"broadband service, or the graphics switching service)."
msgstr ""
"Un servici en rèireplan qu’es executat sus aqueste ordenador capita pas de "
"s’aviar (lo servici de banda larga mobila o lo servici de bascula grafica)."

msgid "A bottom bar, with a start menu on the logo"
msgstr "Una barra en bas, amb un menú Aviar sul lògo"

msgid "A broken app box"
msgstr "Una bóstia d’aplicacions avariada"

msgid "A built-in camera of the newer laptop kind was found."
msgstr "S’es trobada una camèra integrada del tipe dels portatius mai recents."

msgid "A café, hotel, airport, or anywhere else. Nothing gets in."
msgstr "Un cafè, un otèl, un aeropòrt o endacòm mai. Res i pòt pas dintrar."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "A certificate needs attention"
msgid_plural "{n} certificates need attention"
msgstr[0] "{n} certificat demanda vòstra atencion"
msgstr[1] "{n} certificats demandan vòstra atencion"

msgid ""
"A change to the boot options is waiting. It starts at your next restart. It isn't an update.\n"
"\n"
"If you don't want it: Don't use it. The computer starts with the boot options it has now, and automatic updates aren't paused.\n"
"\n"
"Or Keep it."
msgstr ""
"Una modificacion de las opcions d’aviada es en espèra. S’aplicarà a la reaviada que ven. Es pas una mesa a jorn.\n"
"\n"
"Se la volètz pas: Utilizar pas. L’ordenador s’avia amb las opcions d’aviada qu’a ara, e las mesas a jorn automaticas son pas suspendudas.\n"
"\n"
"O Gardar."

msgid "A device"
msgstr "Un periferic"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "A device lost its driver ({driver})"
msgstr "Un periferic a perdut son pilòt ({driver})"

msgid "A disk is hidden."
msgstr "Un disc es amagat."

msgid "A driver file from the maker"
msgstr "Un fichièr de pilòt del fabricant"

msgid "A file of recent errors to email to your helper"
msgstr ""
"Un fichièr de las errors recentas de mandar per corrièl a la persona que vos "
"ajuda"

msgid "A full name can't have : or , in it."
msgstr "Un nom complet pòt pas conténer « : » ni « , »."

msgid "A graphics chip has no driver."
msgstr "Una puça grafica a pas de pilòt."

msgid ""
"A network is only needed for automatic time and time zone. To use Wi-Fi, "
"click a network. Or click Next to go on without it."
msgstr ""
"Una ret es pas necessària que per l’ora e lo fus orari automatics. Per "
"utilizar lo Wi-Fi, clicatz sus una ret. O clicatz sus Seguent per contunhar "
"sens ret."

msgid ""
"A new layout shows after you log out and back in. It changes only your own "
"desktop."
msgstr ""
"Una disposicion novèla apareis aprèp vos èsser desconnectat e tornat "
"connectar. Modifica pas que vòstre pròpri burèu."

msgid "A new system is ready."
msgstr "Un sistèma novèl es prèst."

msgid "A new system is ready. Restart to use it."
msgstr "Un sistèma novèl es prèst. Reaviatz per l’utilizar."

msgid ""
"A new system version is used from the next restart. Keep working, and restart"
" when it suits you."
msgstr ""
"Una version novèla del sistèma serà utilizada a partir de la reaviada que "
"ven. Contunhatz de trabalhar e reaviatz quand vos conven."

msgid ""
"A new version also goes back if something that worked before is broken after "
"you log in, like sound, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, the camera or printing. Unplugged "
"or switched-off things don't count."
msgstr ""
"Una version novèla es tanben anullada se quicòm que foncionava abans es "
"avariat aprèp vòstra connexion, coma lo son, lo Wi-Fi, lo Bluetooth, la "
"camèra o l’impression. Los aparelhs desbrancats o atudats comptan pas."

msgid "A new version is ready"
msgstr "Una version novèla es prèsta"

msgid ""
"A note at the next login says so and names what broke, and automatic updates "
"pause for 3 days."
msgstr ""
"Una nòta a la connexion seguenta o indica e nomena çò qu’es avariat, e las "
"mesas a jorn automaticas son suspendudas per 3 jorns."

msgid ""
"A rollback test copy is running. Restart first, so the computer goes back to "
"the usual version."
msgstr ""
"Una còpia de tèst del retorn en arrièr es en cors. Reaviatz d’en primièr, per"
" que l’ordenador torne a la version abituala."

msgid "A security certificate expired, expires within 30 days, or was removed."
msgstr ""
"Un certificat de seguretat a expirat, expira dins 30 jorns o es estat "
"suprimit."

msgid "A slideshow of your own pictures"
msgstr "Un diaporama de vòstres pròpris imatges"

msgid "A sound chip was found, but it didn't start."
msgstr "S’es trobada una puça sonòra, mas s’es pas aviada."

msgid "A start-up check fails"
msgstr "Una verificacion a l’aviada fonciona pas"

msgid ""
"A start-up check fails on purpose. The computer restarts by itself within "
"seconds, twice, and the third start is back on this version."
msgstr ""
"Una verificacion a l’aviada fracassa exprès. L’ordenador se reavia sol en "
"qualques segondas, doas vegadas, e la tresena aviada se fa tornamai sus "
"aquesta version."

msgid "A system service fails"
msgstr "Un servici del sistèma fonciona pas"

msgid "A system update is also waiting for a restart."
msgstr "Una mesa a jorn del sistèma espèra tanben una reaviada."

msgid "A tool"
msgstr "Una aisina"

msgid "A top bar, with the logo menu at the top left"
msgstr "Una barra en naut, amb lo menú del lògo en naut a esquèrra"

msgid ""
"A user name uses small letters, digits, - and _, and starts with a letter."
msgstr ""
"Un nom d’utilizaire utiliza de letras minusculas, de chifras, - e _, e "
"comença per una letra."

msgid ""
"A wired network is set to Home, so this happens on any cable you plug in."
msgstr ""
"Una ret filara es definida coma Ostal, doncas aquò se passa amb quin cable "
"que siá que brancatz."

msgid "A wireless chip was found, but it didn't start."
msgstr "S’es trobada una puça sens fil, mas s’es pas aviada."

msgid "A wireless chip was found, with no driver for it."
msgstr "S’es trobada una puça sens fil, sens pilòt per ela."

msgid "AMD: flicker, turn off Panel Replay"
msgstr "AMD: tremolament, desactivar Panel Replay"

msgid "AMD: flicker, turn off Panel Self Refresh"
msgstr "AMD: tremolament, desactivar Panel Self Refresh"

msgid "AMD: flicker, turn off both"
msgstr "AMD: tremolament, desactivar los dos"

msgid "AMD: screen dims or shifts colors on its own"
msgstr "AMD: l’ecran s’enfosquís o cambia de colors tot sol"

msgid "AMD: white flickering"
msgstr "AMD: tremolament blanc"

msgid ""
"About 20 seconds after the login screen shows, the computer locks up. Hold "
"the power button until it turns off, then turn it on. After the second "
"freeze, the next start is back on this version."
msgstr ""
"Environ 20 segondas aprèp l’aparicion de l’ecran de connexion, l’ordenador se"
" bloca. Tenètz quichat lo boton d’alimentacion fins que s’atude, puèi "
"tornatz-lo alucar. Aprèp lo segond blocatge, l’aviada seguenta se fa tornamai"
" sus aquesta version."

msgid "About it"
msgstr "A prepaus"

msgid "About this driver"
msgstr "A prepaus d’aqueste pilòt"

msgid "Accent color and wallpaper"
msgstr "Color afortida e rèireplan"

msgid "Account"
msgstr "Compte"

msgid "Add"
msgstr "Apondre"

msgid "Add a folder"
msgstr "Apondre un dorsièr"

msgid "Add a folder and set the sharing password below."
msgstr "Apondètz un dorsièr e definissètz lo senhal de partiment çai-jos."

msgid "Add a folder from your home folder."
msgstr "Apondètz un dorsièr de vòstre dorsièr personal."

msgid "Add a printer"
msgstr "Apondre una imprimenta"

msgid "Add a setting, like amdgpu.abmlevel=0"
msgstr "Apondre un paramètre, coma amdgpu.abmlevel=0"

msgid "Add anyway"
msgstr "Apondre çaquelà"

msgid "Add it"
msgstr "L’apondre"

msgid ""
"Add it only if you know you need it. If the computer then won't start, "
"automatic rollback goes back to the version before."
msgstr ""
"Apondètz-lo sonque se sabètz que n’avètz besonh. Se l’ordenador s’avia pas "
"pus aprèp, lo retorn en arrièr automatic torna a la version d’abans."

msgid "Add or remove an app's hardware rules"
msgstr "Apondre o suprimir las règlas de material d’una aplicacion"

msgid "Add or remove media codecs"
msgstr "Apondre o suprimir de codecs multimèdia"

msgid "Add the media codecs"
msgstr "Apondre los codecs multimèdia"

msgid "Add to the system"
msgstr "Apondre al sistèma"

msgid "Add video and audio codecs"
msgstr "Apondre de codecs vidèo e àudio"

msgid "Add, turn on or remove a VPN or an app's background service"
msgstr ""
"Apondre, activar o suprimir un VPN o lo servici en rèireplan d’una aplicacion"

msgid "Added by you"
msgstr "Apondut per vos"

msgid "Added to this computer"
msgstr "Apondut a aqueste ordenador"

msgid "Adding a printer, and printer driver files from the maker"
msgstr ""
"Apondon d’una imprimenta, e fichièrs de pilòt d’imprimenta del fabricant"

msgid ""
"Adding the desktop parts apps expect (progress windows and notifications)"
msgstr ""
"Apondon dels elements del burèu qu’esperan las aplicacions (fenèstras de "
"progression e notificacions)"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding the download source {name}"
msgstr "Apondon de la font de telecargament {name}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding {title} to the system"
msgstr "Apondon de {title} al sistèma"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding {title} to the system from Fedora. A progress window shows it."
msgstr ""
"Apondon de {title} al sistèma a partir de Fedora. Una fenèstra de progression"
" o mòstra."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding {title} to the system from Fedora. This can take a few minutes."
msgstr ""
"Apondon de {title} al sistèma a partir de Fedora. Aquò pòt prendre qualques "
"minutas."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding {title} to the system. A progress window shows it."
msgstr "Apondon de {title} al sistèma. Una fenèstra de progression o mòstra."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding {title} to the system. This can take a few minutes."
msgstr "Apondon de {title} al sistèma. Aquò pòt prendre qualques minutas."

msgid "Administrator"
msgstr "Administrator"

msgid "Administrator account (root)"
msgstr "Compte d’administrator (root)"

msgid "Administrator: no."
msgstr "Administrator: non."

msgid "Administrator: yes."
msgstr "Administrator: òc."

msgid ""
"After a BIOS update, it may ask for the disk password again. Turn it on again"
" here."
msgstr ""
"Aprèp una mesa a jorn del BIOS, se pòt que vos demande tornamai lo senhal del"
" disc. Tornatz-lo activar aquí."

msgid ""
"After an undo, so the same update doesn't come straight back. They turn back "
"on by themselves."
msgstr ""
"Aprèp una anullacion, per que la meteissa mesa a jorn torne pas tanlèu. Se "
"tornan activar solas."

msgid "After the restart, you will be asked to add your printer."
msgstr "Aprèp la reaviada, vos serà demandat d’apondre vòstra imprimenta."

msgid ""
"After the restart, you'll be asked for your password once, to turn it on."
msgstr ""
"Aprèp la reaviada, vòstre senhal vos serà demandat un còp, per l’activar."

msgid "After the restart, you'll get a message when it's ready."
msgstr "Aprèp la reaviada, recebretz un messatge quand serà prèst."

msgid "Alpha"
msgstr "Alfa"

msgid "Also let in, on Home"
msgstr "Daissar dintrar tanben, sus Ostal"

msgid ""
"Alt+Tab switches between apps. Alt and the key above Tab switches between "
"windows of the same app."
msgstr ""
"Alt+Tab bascula d’una aplicacion a l’autra. Alt e la tòca en dessús de Tab "
"bascula entre las fenèstras de la meteissa aplicacion."

msgid ""
"An .rpm or .deb installs the app. An .exe or .msi gets its Linux version."
msgstr ""
"Un .rpm o un .deb installa l’aplicacion. Un .exe o un .msi obten sa version "
"Linux."

msgid "An app that comes as a .rpm or .deb file"
msgstr "Una aplicacion que ven en fichièr .rpm o .deb"

msgid "An office. Nothing gets in, and your folders aren't shared."
msgstr "Un burèu. Res i dintra pas, e vòstres dorsièrs son pas partejats."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"An update from {staged} is waiting. It starts at your next restart. The version you're using now is from {booted}.\n"
"\n"
"If you don't want it: Don't use it. Your computer keeps the version it has now. A boot options change made since the update came is dropped with it."
msgstr ""
"Una mesa a jorn del {staged} es en espèra. S’aplicarà a la reaviada que ven. La version qu’utilizatz ara data del {booted}.\n"
"\n"
"Se la volètz pas: Utilizar pas. Vòstre ordenador garda la version qu’a ara. Una modificacion de las opcions d’aviada facha dempuèi l’arribada de la mesa a jorn es abandonada amb ela."

msgid "An update is waiting for a restart. Restart first, then run the test."
msgstr ""
"Una mesa a jorn espèra una reaviada. Reaviatz d’en primièr, puèi lançatz lo "
"tèst."

msgid "Another disk is hidden by a BIOS setting."
msgstr "Un autre disc es amagat per un paramètre del BIOS."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Another install or removal is running ({doing}). This waits for it to finish,"
" then goes on."
msgstr ""
"Una autra installacion o supression es en cors ({doing}). Aquò espèra que "
"s’acabe, puèi contunha."

msgid ""
"Another version is set to start at your next restart (after Undo the last "
"update, or picking a version in the boot menu), so the test wouldn't test "
"anything. Restart first, then run the test."
msgstr ""
"Una autra version es prevista per s’aviar a la reaviada que ven (aprèp "
"Anullar la darrièra mesa a jorn, o la causida d’una version dins lo menú "
"d’aviada), doncas lo tèst testariá pas res. Reaviatz d’en primièr, puèi "
"lançatz lo tèst."

msgid "App"
msgstr "Aplicacion"

msgid "App, game or port number"
msgstr "Aplicacion, jòc o numèro de pòrt"

msgid ""
"Applies them at login: the next slide for \"at each login\", and dark or "
"light for the time of day"
msgstr ""
"Los aplica a la connexion: lo diapositiu seguent per « A cada connexion », e "
"escur o clar segon l’ora del jorn"

msgid "Apps"
msgstr "Aplicacions"

msgid "Apps and ports let in"
msgstr "Aplicacions e pòrts autorizats a dintrar"

msgid "Apps from Bazaar have this setting inside the app."
msgstr "Las aplicacions de Bazaar an aqueste paramètre dins l’aplicacion."

msgid "Apps from Bazaar update on their own. Remove them in Bazaar too."
msgstr ""
"Las aplicacions de Bazaar se meton a jorn solas. Suprimissètz-las tanben dins"
" Bazaar."

msgid "Apps from Bazaar: open Bazaar and remove it there."
msgstr "Aplicacions de Bazaar: dobrissètz Bazaar e suprimissètz-la aquí."

msgid ""
"Apps from a file, Get a VPN or a Windows program: Wheelhouse, Apps, Remove "
"apps."
msgstr ""
"Aplicacions d’un fichièr, Obténer un VPN o un programa Windows: Wheelhouse, "
"Aplicacions, Suprimir d’aplicacions."

msgid ""
"Apps from a file: open Wheelhouse, Apps, Start apps at login, and pick the "
"app. Picking it again stops it."
msgstr ""
"Aplicacions d’un fichièr: dobrissètz Wheelhouse, Aplicacions, Lançar "
"d’aplicacions a la connexion, e causissètz l’aplicacion. La causir tornamai "
"l’arrèsta."

msgid "Apps from package files"
msgstr "Aplicacions de fichièrs de paquet"

msgid "Apps from their own download sources"
msgstr "Aplicacions de lors pròprias fonts de telecargament"

msgid "Apps you added from files, Get a VPN or Windows programs"
msgstr ""
"Aplicacions qu’avètz apondudas de fichièrs, Obténer un VPN o programas "
"Windows"

msgid "April"
msgstr "abril"

msgid ""
"ArtCraft's downloads can't be reached right now. Check the internet "
"connection and try again."
msgstr ""
