#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Install {title}\n"
"\n"
"In a box, these parts of {title} won't work:\n"
"{notes}\n"
"A .deb file can't go on the system. For everything to work, look for {title} as an .rpm file or in Bazaar, the app store.\n"
"\n"
"{setup}: puts it in a box anyway, without those parts."
msgstr ""
"Installar {title}\n"
"\n"
"Dins una bóstia, aquestas parts de {title} foncionaràn pas:\n"
"{notes}\n"
"Un fichièr .deb pòt pas anar sul sistèma. Per que tot foncione, cercatz {title} en fichièr .rpm o dins Bazaar, la botiga d’aplicacions.\n"
"\n"
"{setup}: lo met çaquelà dins una bóstia, sens aquestas parts."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Install {title}\n"
"\n"
"It comes from {maker}'s own download source, which is added to the system so {title} keeps updating. Needs your password and a restart.\n"
"\n"
"To connect, you need a {maker} account."
msgstr ""
"Installar {title}\n"
"\n"
"Ven de la pròpria font de telecargament de {maker}, que s’apond al sistèma per que {title} contunhe de se metre a jorn. Demanda vòstre senhal e una reaviada.\n"
"\n"
"Per vos connectar, vos cal un compte {maker}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Install {title}\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Add to the system. In a box, these parts of {title} won't work:\n"
"{notes}\n"
"On the system, everything works. Needs your password and a restart.\n"
"\n"
"Or {setup}: puts it in a separate box. It's easier to remove, but those parts won't work."
msgstr ""
"Installar {title}\n"
"\n"
"Recomandat: Apondre al sistèma. Dins una bóstia, aquestas parts de {title} foncionaràn pas:\n"
"{notes}\n"
"Sul sistèma, tot fonciona. Demanda vòstre senhal e una reaviada.\n"
"\n"
"O {setup}: lo met dins una bóstia separada. Es mai aisit de suprimir, mas aquestas parts foncionaràn pas."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Install {title}\n"
"\n"
"{setup}: puts it in a separate box. Your system isn't changed, and Remove Apps takes it out cleanly."
msgstr ""
"Installar {title}\n"
"\n"
"{setup}: lo met dins una bóstia separada. Vòstre sistèma es pas modificat, e Suprimir d’aplicacions lo lèva proprament."

