"Not yet: nothing restarts until you click Restart now, so you can save your "
"work first."
msgstr ""
"Pas encara: res se reavia pas tant que clicatz pas sus Reaviar ara, per que "
"poscatz enregistrar d’en primièr vòstre trabalh."

msgid ""
"Notepad: Text Editor. Photos: Image Viewer. Videos: Celluloid. Music: "
"Lollypop. PDFs: Papers."
msgstr ""
"Bloc-nòtas: Editor de tèxte. Fòtos: Visionador d’imatges. Vidèos: Celluloid. "
"Musica: Lollypop. PDF: Papers."

msgid ""
"Nothing can reach this computer from the network, and your folders aren't "
"shared. Office shared drives and printers still work."
msgstr ""
"Res pòt pas aténher aqueste ordenador a partir de la ret, e vòstres dorsièrs "
"son pas partejats. Los lectors partejats e las imprimentas del burèu "
"foncionan totjorn."

msgid ""
"Nothing can reach this computer from the network. Finding printers still "
"works."
msgstr ""
"Res pòt pas aténher aqueste ordenador a partir de la ret. La recèrca "
"d’imprimentas fonciona totjorn."

msgid "Nothing changed."
msgstr "Res a pas cambiat."

msgid "Nothing extra on Home"
msgstr "Res de mai sus Ostal"

msgid "Nothing extra on Work"
msgstr "Res de mai sus Trabalh"

msgid "Nothing extra on a Public place"
msgstr "Res de mai sus un Luòc public"

msgid "Nothing has been installed with Install Package File yet."
msgstr "Res es pas encara estat installat amb Installar un fichièr de paquet."

msgid "Nothing is shared yet"
msgstr "Res es pas encara partejat"

msgid "Nothing matches"
msgstr "Cap de resultat"

msgid ""
"Nothing more was changed on the disk. Save the log puts the details on a USB "
"stick for your helper; no account is needed. Show a QR code sends a report "
"from your phone, and Report on GitHub sends it from Firefox; both need a free"
" GitHub account. Or click Restart."
msgstr ""
"Res mai es pas estat modificat sul disc. Enregistrar lo jornal met los "
"detalhs sus una clau USB per la persona que vos ajuda; cal pas cap de compte."
" Mostrar un còdi QR manda un rapòrt a partir de vòstre telefòn, e Senhalar "
"sus GitHub lo manda a partir de Firefox; los dos demandan un compte GitHub "
"gratuit. O clicatz sus Reaviar."

msgid "Nothing to change: Zoom meetings open in Chrome, or the first one asks."
msgstr ""
"Res de cambiar: las reünions Zoom se dobrisson dins Chrome, o la primièra o "
"demanda."

msgid "Nothing updates until you run System Update."
msgstr "Res se met pas a jorn tant qu’executatz pas Mesa a jorn del sistèma."

msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "Notificacions"

msgid "November"
msgstr "novembre"

msgid "OK"
msgstr "D’acòrdi"

msgid "October"
msgstr "octòbre"

msgid "Off"
msgstr "Desactivat"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Off here: {name} is {place}."
msgstr "Desactivat aquí: {name} es {place}."

msgid "Off unless you need it"
msgstr "Desactivat levat se n’avètz besonh"

msgid "Off. Skip the disk password at startup."
msgstr "Desactivat. Sautar lo senhal del disc a l’aviada."

msgid "Off. Turn them on or off."
msgstr "Desactivadas. Las activar o las desactivar."

msgid "On Home, use the switch for it above."
msgstr "Sus Ostal, utilizatz l’alternator çai-dessús."

msgid "On a Mac: Finder, Network. On another Linux computer: Files, Network."
msgstr "Sus un Mac: Finder, Ret. Sus un autre ordenador Linux: Fichièrs, Ret."

msgid ""
"On a Public place it asks first, because strangers could reach it too. The "
"bin next to it closes it again."
msgstr ""
"Sus un Luòc public, demanda d’en primièr, perque d’estrangièrs i poirián "
"tanben accedir. L’escobilhièr al costat lo torna tampar."

msgid ""
"On a Windows PC: File Explorer, Network. The Windows PC's own network must be"
" set to Private."
msgstr ""
"Sus un PC Windows: Explorador de fichièrs, Ret. La ret del PC Windows deu "
"èsser definida sus Privat."

msgid ""
"On top of what the place itself lets in. Each change asks for your password."
msgstr ""
"En mai de çò que lo luòc el meteis daissa dintrar. Cada modificacion demanda "
"vòstre senhal."

msgid "On. Skip the disk password at startup."
msgstr "Activat. Sautar lo senhal del disc a l’aviada."

msgid "On. Turn them on or off."
msgstr "Activadas. Las activar o las desactivar."

msgid "One file at a time: the first one is opening."
msgstr "Un fichièr a la vegada: lo primièr se dobrís."

msgid "Open"
msgstr "Dobrir"

msgid "Open Bazaar"
msgstr "Dobrir Bazaar"

msgid "Open Bazaar, the app store, from the start menu or the dock."
msgstr ""
"Dobrissètz Bazaar, la botiga d’aplicacions, a partir del menú Aviar o del "
"dock."

msgid ""
"Open Files from the start menu or the dock. It opens on your home folder."
msgstr ""
"Dobrissètz Fichièrs a partir del menú Aviar o del dock. Se dobrís sus vòstre "
"dorsièr personal."

msgid "Open Install Package File"
msgstr "Dobrir Installar un fichièr de paquet"

msgid "Open Printers"
msgstr "Dobrir Imprimentas"

msgid "Open Settings, Appearance."
msgstr "Dobrissètz Paramètres, Aparéncia."

msgid "Open Settings, Apps, Default Apps."
msgstr "Dobrissètz Paramètres, Aplicacions, Aplicacions per defaut."

msgid "Open Settings, Bluetooth, and turn on the switch at the top."
msgstr "Dobrissètz Paramètres, Bluetooth, e activatz l’alternator en naut."

msgid ""
"Open Settings, Displays, Night Light, and turn it on. It follows sunset and "
"sunrise, or set your own times."
msgstr ""
"Dobrissètz Paramètres, Afichatge, Mòde nuèit, e activatz-lo. Seguís lo colcar"
" e lo levar del solelh, o definissètz vòstras pròprias oras."

msgid "Open Settings, Displays."
msgstr "Dobrissètz Paramètres, Afichatge."

msgid "Open Settings, Printers, and click Add Printer."
msgstr ""
"Dobrissètz Paramètres, Imprimentas, e clicatz sus Apondre una imprimenta."

msgid "Open Settings, Sound."
msgstr "Dobrissètz Paramètres, Son."

msgid "Open Settings, System, Users."
msgstr "Dobrissètz Paramètres, Sistèma, Utilizaires."

msgid "Open Wheelhouse"
msgstr "Dobrir Wheelhouse"

msgid "Open Wheelhouse on its Updates page"
msgstr "Dobrir Wheelhouse sus la pagina Mesas a jorn"

msgid "Open Wheelhouse, Apps, Get a VPN."
msgstr "Dobrissètz Wheelhouse, Aplicacions, Obténer un VPN."

msgid "Open Wheelhouse, Apps, Media codecs."
msgstr "Dobrissètz Wheelhouse, Aplicacions, Codecs multimèdia."

msgid "Open Wheelhouse, Disk and startup, Restart into BIOS settings."
msgstr ""
"Dobrissètz Wheelhouse, Disc e aviada, Reaviar dins los paramètres del BIOS."

msgid "Open Wheelhouse, Disk and startup, Unlock disk automatically."
msgstr ""
"Dobrissètz Wheelhouse, Disc e aviada, Desverrolhar lo disc automaticament."

msgid "Open Wheelhouse, Disk and startup. The bar shows how much is free."
msgstr ""
"Dobrissètz Wheelhouse, Disc e aviada. La barra mòstra quant d’espaci es "
"liure."

msgid ""
"Open Wheelhouse, Disk and startup. Under Common fixes, turn on the one that "
"matches the problem."
msgstr ""
"Dobrissètz Wheelhouse, Disc e aviada. Jos Correccions correntas, activatz la "
"que correspond al problèma."

msgid "Open Wheelhouse, Get help, Certificate alerts to see them."
msgstr ""
"Dobrissètz Wheelhouse, Obténer d’ajuda, Alèrtas de certificat per las veire."

msgid "Open Wheelhouse, Get help, Save problem details."
msgstr ""
"Dobrissètz Wheelhouse, Obténer d’ajuda, Enregistrar los detalhs del problèma."

msgid ""
"Open Wheelhouse, Get help, Test automatic rollback. Save your work first."
msgstr ""
"Dobrissètz Wheelhouse, Obténer d’ajuda, Testar lo retorn en arrièr automatic."
" Enregistratz d’en primièr vòstre trabalh."

msgid ""
"Open Wheelhouse, Get help, and scroll to the end. Every tool has its command "
"there."
msgstr ""
"Dobrissètz Wheelhouse, Obténer d’ajuda, e fasètz desfilar fins a la fin. Cada"
" aisina i a sa comanda."

msgid "Open Wheelhouse, Make it yours, Desktop layout."
msgstr "Dobrissètz Wheelhouse, Personalizar, Disposicion del burèu."

msgid "Open Wheelhouse, Make it yours, Fonts and text."
msgstr "Dobrissètz Wheelhouse, Personalizar, Poliças e tèxte."

msgid "Open Wheelhouse, Make it yours, Light and dark."
msgstr "Dobrissètz Wheelhouse, Personalizar, Clar e escur."

msgid "Open Wheelhouse, Make it yours, Wallpaper slideshow, and click Choose."
msgstr ""
"Dobrissètz Wheelhouse, Personalizar, Diaporama de rèireplan, e clicatz sus "
"Causir."

msgid "Open Wheelhouse, Make it yours."
msgstr "Dobrissètz Wheelhouse, Personalizar."

msgid ""
"Open Wheelhouse, Network safety. Under Also let in, on Home, there are two "
"switches."
msgstr ""
"Dobrissètz Wheelhouse, Seguretat de la ret. Jos Daissar dintrar tanben, sus "
"Ostal, i a dos alternators."

msgid ""
"Open Wheelhouse, Network safety. Under Apps and ports let in, pick the place."
msgstr ""
"Dobrissètz Wheelhouse, Seguretat de la ret. Jos Aplicacions e pòrts "
"autorizats a dintrar, causissètz lo luòc."

msgid ""
"Open Wheelhouse, Network safety. Your networks lists every network this "
"computer has joined."
msgstr ""
"Dobrissètz Wheelhouse, Seguretat de la ret. Vòstras rets lista totas las rets"
" qu’aqueste ordenador a rejuntas."

msgid "Open Wheelhouse, Shared folders."
msgstr "Dobrissètz Wheelhouse, Dorsièrs partejats."

msgid "Open Wheelhouse, Updates, Automatic updates. On is recommended."
msgstr ""
"Dobrissètz Wheelhouse, Mesas a jorn, Mesas a jorn automaticas. Activat es "
"recomandat."

msgid ""
"Open Wi-Fi, with no password, is always a Public place, because anyone can "
"make one with the same name."
msgstr ""
"Un Wi-Fi dobèrt, sens senhal, es totjorn un Luòc public, perque qual que siá "
"ne pòt crear un amb lo meteis nom."

msgid "Open a port"
msgstr "Dobrir un pòrt"

msgid "Open a port on Home"
msgstr "Dobrir un pòrt sus Ostal"

msgid "Open a port on Work"
msgstr "Dobrir un pòrt sus Trabalh"

msgid "Open a port on a Public place"
msgstr "Dobrir un pòrt sus un Luòc public"

msgid "Open an app"
msgstr "Dobrir una aplicacion"

msgid "Open it"
msgstr "Lo dobrir"

msgid "Open the computer's BIOS settings screen"
msgstr "Dobrir l’ecran dels paramètres del BIOS de l’ordenador"

msgid "Open the computer's own settings screen"
msgstr "Dobrir l’ecran de paramètres pròpri de l’ordenador"

msgid "Open the file again to install it."
msgstr "Tornatz dobrir lo fichièr per l’installar."

msgid "Open the file, or drop it on Wheelhouse, Apps."
msgstr "Dobrissètz lo fichièr, o depausatz-lo sus Wheelhouse, Aplicacions."

msgid "Open the file, or use Install a package file in Wheelhouse, Apps."
msgstr ""
"Dobrissètz lo fichièr, o utilizatz Installar un fichièr de paquet dins "
"Wheelhouse, Aplicacions."

msgid ""
"Open this computer, type your user name and the sharing password, and the "
"folders are there."
msgstr ""
"Dobrissètz aqueste ordenador, picatz vòstre nom d’utilizaire e lo senhal de "
"partiment, e los dorsièrs son aquí."

msgid "Open your folders from another computer at home"
msgstr "Dobrir vòstres dorsièrs a partir d’un autre ordenador a l’ostal"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Open {name}"
msgstr "Dobrir {name}"

msgid ""
"Opens New to EvenKeelOS at login, after the setup checklist, until its Don't "
"show this again box is ticked"
msgstr ""
"Dobrís Novèl sus EvenKeelOS? a la connexion, aprèp la lista de configuracion,"
" fins que sa casa « Afichar pas pus aquò » siá marcada"

msgid "Opens a Zoom meeting in Zoom's web version, in Chrome"
msgstr "Dobrís una reünion Zoom dins la version web de Zoom, dins Chrome"

msgid "Opens the setup checklist once, the first time a user logs in"
msgstr ""
"Dobrís la lista de configuracion un còp, la primièra vegada qu’un utilizaire "
"se connècta"

msgid "Optional formats left out for legal reasons"
msgstr "Formats opcionals omeses per de rasons legalas"

msgid "Optional: add the media codecs that are left out for legal reasons"
msgstr "Opcional: apondre los codecs multimèdia omeses per de rasons legalas"

msgid "Or Cancel."
msgstr "O Anullar."

msgid "Or Keep it."
msgstr "O Gardar."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Or Keep it: saves setup time if you'll install another {kind} app soon."
msgstr ""
"O Gardar: estalvia de temps de configuracion se installatz lèu una autra "
"aplicacion {kind}."

msgid ""
"Or use the keyboard: Windows key + Up fills the screen, Windows key + Left or"
" Right fills a half, and Windows key + H minimizes."
msgstr ""
"O utilizatz lo clavièr: la tòca Windows + Naut emplena l’ecran, la tòca "
"Windows + Esquèrra o Drecha emplena una mitat, e la tòca Windows + H redusís "
"la fenèstra."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Or {button}: adds a second copy. {note} You would have two of the same app."
msgstr ""
"O {button}: apond una segonda còpia. {note} Auriatz doas còpias de la "
"meteissa aplicacion."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Other ({zone})"
msgstr "Autre ({zone})"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Other computers ask for your user name, {user}, and this password. It isn't "
"your login password."
msgstr ""
"Los autres ordenadors demandan vòstre nom d’utilizaire, {user}, e aqueste "
"senhal. Es pas vòstre senhal de connexion."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Other computers ask for your user name, {user}, and this password. Use at "
"least {n} character. Your login password doesn't change."
msgid_plural ""
"Other computers ask for your user name, {user}, and this password. Use at "
"least {n} characters. Your login password doesn't change."
msgstr[0] ""
"Los autres ordenadors demandan vòstre nom d’utilizaire, {user}, e aqueste "
"senhal. Utilizatz almens {n} caractèr. Vòstre senhal de connexion cambia pas."
msgstr[1] ""
"Los autres ordenadors demandan vòstre nom d’utilizaire, {user}, e aqueste "
"senhal. Utilizatz almens {n} caractèrs. Vòstre senhal de connexion cambia "
"pas."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Other computers find this one as {host}: in Files under Network on Linux, in "
"Finder under Network on a Mac, and under Network in File Explorer on Windows."
msgstr ""
"Los autres ordenadors tròban aqueste coma {host}: dins Fichièrs jos Ret sus "
"Linux, dins Finder jos Ret sus un Mac, e jos Ret dins l’Explorador de "
"fichièrs sus Windows."

msgid ""
"Other computers open these as you, so whatever they save belongs to you."
msgstr ""
"Los autres ordenadors los dobrisson en vòstre nom, doncas tot çò qu’i "
"enregistran vos aparten."

msgid "Other computers print to a printer plugged into this one"
msgstr ""
"Los autres ordenadors imprimisson sus una imprimenta brancada a aqueste"

msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Vista d’ensemble"

msgid "Packages (.rpm, .deb)"
msgstr "Paquets (.rpm, .deb)"

msgid "Password"
msgstr "Senhal"

msgid "Paused. Turn them on or off."
msgstr "Suspendudas. Las activar o las desactivar."

msgid "Pausing automatic updates."
msgstr "Suspension de las mesas a jorn automaticas."

msgid ""
"Phones, file sharing and apps you run can reach this computer. System "
"services stay closed unless switched on below."
msgstr ""
"Los telefòns, lo partiment de fichièrs e las aplicacions qu’executatz pòdon "
"aténher aqueste ordenador. Los servicis del sistèma demòran tampats levat se "
"son activats çai-jos."

msgid "Pick Home, Work or Public place for it below."
msgstr "Causissètz Ostal, Trabalh o Luòc public per ela çai-jos."

msgid ""
"Pick Mullvad, Proton, IVPN or NordVPN. It's added from that company's own "
"download source, and kept up to date."
msgstr ""
"Causissètz Mullvad, Proton, IVPN o NordVPN. Es apondut a partir de la pròpria"
" font de telecargament d’aquela entrepresa, e tengut a jorn."

msgid ""
"Pick Sunset to sunrise, or Custom times and pick when dark starts and ends."
msgstr ""
"Causissètz Del colcar al levar del solelh, o Oras personalizadas e causissètz"
" quand l’escur comença e s’acaba."

msgid ""
"Pick Windows-style (a bar at the bottom and a start menu) or Standard (a bar "
"at the top and a dock)."
msgstr ""
"Causissètz Estil Windows (una barra en bas e un menú Aviar) o Estandard (una "
"barra en naut e un dock)."

msgid "Pick Windows-style or Standard, click Switch, then log out and back in."
msgstr ""
"Causissètz Estil Windows o Estandard, clicatz sus Cambiar, puèi "
"desconnectatz-vos e tornatz-vos connectar."

msgid "Pick a Windows program"
msgstr "Causir un programa Windows"

msgid "Pick a file"
msgstr "Causir un fichièr"

msgid "Pick a folder inside your home folder."
msgstr "Causissètz un dorsièr dins vòstre dorsièr personal."

msgid "Pick a folder of pictures"
msgstr "Causir un dorsièr d’imatges"

msgid "Pick a folder to share"
msgstr "Causir un dorsièr de partejar"

msgid "Pick a folder, not a file."
msgstr "Causissètz un dorsièr, pas un fichièr."

msgid "Pick a problem to test. Your computer should fix it by itself."
msgstr ""
"Causissètz un problèma de testar. Vòstre ordenador lo deuriá corregir sol."

msgid "Pick a test, click Start the test, and type your password."
msgstr ""
"Causissètz un tèst, clicatz sus Començar lo tèst, e picatz vòstre senhal."

msgid "Pick an .exe or .msi to get its Linux version"
msgstr "Causir un .exe o un .msi per obténer sa version Linux"

msgid "Pick an .rpm or .deb file from Downloads"
msgstr "Causir un fichièr .rpm o .deb de Downloads (Telecargaments)"

msgid "Pick an app or game so other computers can reach it"
msgstr ""
"Causir una aplicacion o un jòc per que los autres ordenadors i pòscan accedir"

msgid "Pick it again in Get a VPN."
msgstr "Tornatz-lo causir dins Obténer un VPN."

msgid "Pick one."
msgstr "Causissètz-ne un."

msgid "Pick the app for the web, mail, calendar, music, videos and photos."
msgstr ""
"Causissètz l’aplicacion pel web, lo corrièl, lo calendièr, la musica, las "
"vidèos e las fòtos."

msgid ""
"Pick the app. To use it every time for that kind of file, turn on Always use "
"for this file type first."
msgstr ""
"Causissètz l’aplicacion. Per l’utilizar cada còp per aqueste tipe de fichièr,"
" activatz d’en primièr Totjorn utilizar per aqueste tipe de fichièr."

msgid ""
"Pick the box. It's set up again, with its apps. Your files aren't touched."
msgstr ""
"Causissètz la bóstia. Es tornada configurar, amb sas aplicacions. Vòstres "
"fichièrs son pas tocats."

msgid "Pick the day. Back keeps it as it is."
msgstr "Causissètz lo jorn. Precedent lo garda tal coma es."

msgid ""
"Pick the folder, then how often it changes: every hour, every day or at each "
"login."
msgstr ""
"Causissètz lo dorsièr, puèi cada quant cambia: cada ora, cada jorn o a cada "
"connexion."

msgid "Pick the fonts for menus, documents and code"
msgstr "Causir las poliças dels menús, dels documents e del còdi"

msgid "Pick the hour. Back keeps it as it is."
msgstr "Causissètz l’ora. Precedent la garda tala coma es."

msgid "Pick the minute. Back keeps it as it is."
msgstr "Causissètz la minuta. Precedent la garda tala coma es."

msgid "Pick the month. Back keeps it as it is."
msgstr "Causissètz lo mes. Precedent lo garda tal coma es."

msgid "Pick the place next to a network. It changes at once."
msgstr "Causissètz lo luòc al costat d’una ret. Cambia sulcòp."

msgid ""
"Pick the speakers or headphones under Output Device, and the microphone under"
" Input Device."
msgstr ""
"Causissètz los nauts-parlaires o lo casc jos Periferic de sortida, e lo "
"microfòn jos Periferic d’entrada."

msgid "Pick the year. Back keeps it as it is."
msgstr "Causissètz l’annada. Precedent la garda tala coma es."

msgid "Pick what you need. It explains each choice."
msgstr "Causissètz çò que vos cal. Explica cada causida."

msgid "Pick which ones open when you log in"
msgstr "Causir las que se dobrisson quand vos connectatz"

msgid "Place"
msgstr "Luòc"

msgid ""
"Plug in a USB stick, then click it to save the log on it. Click Refresh if it"
" isn't listed, or Back."
msgstr ""
"Brancatz una clau USB, puèi clicatz-la per i enregistrar lo jornal. Clicatz "
"sus Actualizar s’es pas listada, o sus Precedent."

msgid "Plug in a second USB stick, then click Save the results again."
msgstr ""
"Brancatz una segonda clau USB, puèi clicatz tornamai sus Enregistrar los "
"resultats."

msgid ""
"Plug in a second USB stick, then click it to save the log on it. Or click "
"Back."
msgstr ""
"Brancatz una segonda clau USB, puèi clicatz-la per i enregistrar lo jornal. O"
" clicatz sus Precedent."

msgid "Plug it in. It shows in the left side of Files."
msgstr "Brancatz-la. Apareis a esquèrra dins Fichièrs."

msgid "Plug the computer in. Open Wheelhouse, Updates, Update firmware."
msgstr ""
"Brancatz l’ordenador sul sector. Dobrissètz Wheelhouse, Mesas a jorn, Metre a"
" jorn lo micrologicial."

msgid ""
"Point your phone's camera at the code. It opens the report on GitHub with the"
" details filled in. To send it, sign in to GitHub, or make a free account if "
"you don't have one. It carries the end of the log; the whole log can go on a "
"USB stick. Click Back when done."
msgstr ""
"Viratz la camèra de vòstre telefòn cap al còdi. Dobrís lo rapòrt sus GitHub "
"amb los detalhs ja emplenats. Per lo mandar, connectatz-vos a GitHub, o "
"creatz un compte gratuit se n’avètz pas. Conten la fin del jornal; lo jornal "
"complet pòt anar sus una clau USB. Clicatz sus Precedent quand avètz acabat."

msgid "Port, like 8080, or a range, like 2456-2458"
msgstr "Pòrt, coma 8080, o una plaja, coma 2456-2458"

msgid "Power modes"
msgstr "Mòdes d’alimentacion"

msgid "Prefer the terminal?"
msgstr "Preferissètz lo terminal?"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Preparing the {label}."
msgstr "Preparacion de la {label}."

msgid ""
"Press Print Screen. Pick the whole screen, a window, or drag over an area, "
"then click the round button."
msgstr ""
"Quichatz Impr. ecran. Causissètz l’ecran complet, una fenèstra, o fasètz "
"lisar sus una zòna, puèi clicatz sul boton redond."

msgid "Printers didn't open. Open Settings, then Printers."
msgstr "Imprimentas s’es pas dobèrt. Dobrissètz Paramètres, puèi Imprimentas."

msgid ""
"Printers is open. Choose Add Printer.\n"
"\n"
"If your printer isn't there or doesn't print right, open this file again and choose Install the driver."
msgstr ""
"Imprimentas es dobèrt. Causissètz Apondre una imprimenta.\n"
"\n"
"Se vòstra imprimenta i es pas o imprimís pas corrèctament, tornatz dobrir aqueste fichièr e causissètz Installar lo pilòt."

msgid ""
"Printers is open. Choose Add Printer.\n"
"\n"
"If your printer isn't there or doesn't print right, open this file again to see how to get the driver."
msgstr ""
"Imprimentas es dobèrt. Causissètz Apondre una imprimenta.\n"
"\n"
"Se vòstra imprimenta i es pas o imprimís pas corrèctament, tornatz dobrir aqueste fichièr per veire cossí obténer lo pilòt."

msgid "Printing"
msgstr "Impression"

msgid "Printing doesn't start"
msgstr "L’impression s’avia pas"

msgid "Printing service off"
msgstr "Servici d’impression desactivat"

msgid "Problem"
msgstr "Problèma"

msgid "Protocol"
msgstr "Protocòl"

msgid "Public place"
