msgid ""
"The layout, colors, wallpaper, dark at night, fonts, screen size, night "
"light, sound and accounts"
msgstr ""
"La disposicion, las colors, lo rèireplan, l’escur la nuèit, las poliças, la "
"talha de l’ecran, lo mòde nuèit, lo son e los comptes"

msgid "The login screen doesn't start"
msgstr "L’ecran de connexion s’avia pas"

msgid ""
"The login screen fails to start, so you never see it. The computer restarts "
"by itself within seconds, twice, and the third start is back on this version."
msgstr ""
"L’ecran de connexion capita pas de s’aviar, doncas lo vesètz pas jamai. "
"L’ordenador se reavia sol en qualques segondas, doas vegadas, e la tresena "
"aviada se fa tornamai sus aquesta version."

msgid ""
"The login screen works, but logging in drops you back to it. Log in a second "
"time; after the second drop the computer restarts by itself. Do that on 2 "
"starts, and the third start is back on this version."
msgstr ""
"L’ecran de connexion fonciona, mas la connexion vos i torna. Connectatz-vos "
"una segonda vegada; aprèp lo segond retorn l’ordenador se reavia sol. Fasètz "
"aquò a 2 aviadas, e la tresena aviada se fa tornamai sus aquesta version."

msgid "The media codecs start working after a restart."
msgstr "Los codecs multimèdia començan de foncionar aprèp una reaviada."

msgid ""
"The menu that opens has Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, the sound volume, the screen "
"brightness, the power mode, dark style and night light."
msgstr ""
"Lo menú que se dobrís a lo Wi-Fi, lo Bluetooth, lo volum del son, la "
"luminositat de l’ecran, lo mòde d’alimentacion, l’estil escur e lo lum "
"nuechenc."

msgid "The new files could not be labelled."
msgstr "Los fichièrs novèls an pas pogut èsser etiquetats."

msgid "The new partitions did not show up."
msgstr "Las particions novèlas son pas aparegudas."

msgid "The new system could not be set to take signed updates."
msgstr ""
"Lo sistèma novèl a pas pogut èsser configurat per recebre de mesas a jorn "
"signadas."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The new system has no {name} group."
msgstr "Lo sistèma novèl a pas de grop {name}."

msgid "The new system's desktop layouts could not be found."
msgstr "Las disposicions de burèu del sistèma novèl son pas estadas trobadas."

msgid "The new system's settings database could not be found."
msgstr ""
"La basa de donadas dels paramètres del sistèma novèl es pas estada trobada."

msgid "The next network you join starts as a Public place."
msgstr "La ret seguenta que rejonhètz comença coma un Luòc public."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The next start uses: {settings}"
msgstr "L’aviada seguenta utiliza: {settings}"

