"The picture is copied, ready to paste, and saved in Pictures, Screenshots."
msgstr ""
"L’imatge es copiat, prèst a èsser pegat, e enregistrat dins Pictures "
"(Imatges), Capturas d’ecran."

msgid ""
"The power button in that menu has Suspend, Restart, Power Off and Log Out."
msgstr ""
"Lo boton d’alimentacion d’aquel menú prepausa Metre en velha, Reaviar, Atudar"
" e Tampar la session."

#, python-brace-format
