msgstr "La reaviada s’es pas aviada"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The restart said:\n"
"\n"
"{message}\n"
"\n"
"Exit code: {code}"
msgstr ""
"La reaviada a respondut:\n"
"\n"
"{message}\n"
"\n"
"Còdi de sortida: {code}"

msgid ""
"The root account is the system's own administrator. Most people never need "
"it: your own account can be an administrator instead."
msgstr ""
"Lo compte root es l’administrator pròpri del sistèma. La màger part del monde"
" n’a pas jamai besonh: vòstre pròpri compte pòt èsser administrator a la "
"plaça."

msgid "The root password could not be set."
msgstr "Lo senhal root a pas pogut èsser definit."

msgid "The screen flashes white, often with an outside display"
msgstr "L’ecran fa de flashs blancs, sovent amb un ecran extèrne"

msgid ""
"The settings are deleted, but the computer didn't restart. Restart it now: "
"the next start puts them back."
msgstr ""
"Los paramètres son suprimits, mas l’ordenador s’es pas reaviat. Reaviatz-lo "
"ara: l’aviada seguenta los restablís."

msgid "The settings repair test didn't work."
msgstr "Lo tèst de reparacion dels paramètres a pas foncionat."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The settings repair test didn't work: your computer couldn't put the deleted settings back, so it went back to the version from {since}, which has its own settings. Your files and apps aren't touched, and automatic updates aren't paused.\n"
"\n"
"Tell your helper. Save problem details in Wheelhouse makes a file to send them."
msgstr ""
"Lo tèst de reparacion dels paramètres a pas foncionat: vòstre ordenador a pas pogut restablir los paramètres suprimits, doncas es tornat a la version del {since}, qu’a sos pròpris paramètres. Vòstres fichièrs e aplicacions son pas tocats, e las mesas a jorn automaticas son pas suspendudas.\n"
"\n"
"Avisatz la persona que vos ajuda. Enregistrar los detalhs del problèma dins Wheelhouse crea un fichièr per los li mandar."

msgid "The settings repair test worked."
msgstr "Lo tèst de reparacion dels paramètres a foncionat."

msgid "The sound chip's driver is blocked, so there's no sound."
msgstr "Lo pilòt de la puça sonòra es blocat, doncas i a pas de son."

msgid ""
"The start menu, windows, the menu at the end of the bar, notifications, "
"screenshots and shortcuts"
msgstr ""
"Lo menú Aviar, las fenèstras, lo menú a la fin de la barra, las "
"notificacions, las capturas d’ecran e los acorchis"

msgid "The sun doesn't set or rise here today, so it's dark until it rises."
msgstr ""
"Lo solelh se colca pas ni se lèva pas aquí uèi, doncas fa escur fins que se "
"lève."

msgid "The sun doesn't set or rise here today, so it's light until it sets."
msgstr ""
"Lo solelh se colca pas ni se lèva pas aquí uèi, doncas fa clar fins que se "
"colque."

msgid "The system core crashed (a protection fault)"
msgstr "Lo nuclèu del sistèma a plantat (una error de proteccion)"

msgid "The system core crashed (an oops)"
msgstr "Lo nuclèu del sistèma a plantat (un « oops »)"

msgid "The system core reported a bug"
msgstr "Lo nuclèu del sistèma a senhalat un bug"

msgid ""
"The system itself can't be changed by apps or by mistake. Each update "
"replaces it whole."
msgstr ""
"Lo sistèma el meteis pòt pas èsser modificat per las aplicacions o per error."
" Cada mesa a jorn lo remplaça en entièr."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The test copy ({name}) is ready. It starts at your next restart."
msgstr "La còpia de tèst ({name}) es prèsta. S’aviarà a la reaviada que ven."

msgid ""
"The test marker is removed. The version without it starts at your next "
"restart."
msgstr ""
"Lo marcador de tèst es suprimit. La version sens el s’aviarà a la reaviada "
"que ven."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The test worked. At the next start your computer found important settings missing, put back {n} setting from the copy it saved {saved}, and restarted by itself.\n"
"\n"
"Put back: {what}."
msgid_plural ""
"The test worked. At the next start your computer found important settings missing, put back {n} settings from the copy it saved {saved}, and restarted by itself.\n"
"\n"
"Put back: {what}."
msgstr[0] ""
"Lo tèst a foncionat. A l’aviada seguenta, vòstre ordenador a constatat que de paramètres importants mancavan, a restablit {n} paramètre a partir de la còpia enregistrada {saved}, e s’es reaviat sol.\n"
"\n"
"Restablit: {what}."
msgstr[1] ""
"Lo tèst a foncionat. A l’aviada seguenta, vòstre ordenador a constatat que de paramètres importants mancavan, a restablit {n} paramètres a partir de la còpia enregistrada {saved}, e s’es reaviat sol.\n"
"\n"
"Restablits: {what}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The test worked. Your computer went back by itself to the version from "
"{since}, and the test copy is removed."
msgstr ""
"Lo tèst a foncionat. Vòstre ordenador es tornat sol a la version del {since},"
" e la còpia de tèst es suprimida."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The touchpad ({device})"
msgstr "Lo pavat tactil ({device})"

msgid "The two don't match yet."
msgstr "Los dos correspondon pas encara."

msgid "The update did not finish. Details: journalctl -u %s"
msgstr "La mesa a jorn s’es pas acabada. Detalhs: journalctl -u %s"

msgid "The update didn't finish."
msgstr "La mesa a jorn s’es pas acabada."

msgid ""
"The update didn't finish. Nothing is broken: your computer keeps running the "
"version it has.\\n\\nTry again later."
msgstr ""
"La mesa a jorn s’es pas acabada. Res es pas avariat: vòstre ordenador "
"contunha d’executar la version qu’a.\\n\\nTornatz ensajar pus tard."

msgid "The update program"
msgstr "Lo programa de mesa a jorn"

msgid ""
"The update program is swapped for one that always fails (until the next "
"restart; nothing on the disk changes)."
msgstr ""
"Lo programa de mesa a jorn es remplaçat per un que fracassa totjorn (fins a "
"la reaviada que ven; res cambia pas sul disc)."

msgid "The user name is empty."
msgstr "Lo nom d’utilizaire es void."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The version you're using now is from {current}. The one from before it, from {older}, is still on this computer.\n"
"\n"
"If something stopped working after the last update: Undo the update. The version from {older} starts at your next restart. Your files and your apps aren't touched."
msgstr ""
"La version qu’utilizatz ara data del {current}. La d’abans, del {older}, es encara sus aqueste ordenador.\n"
"\n"
"Se quicòm fonciona pas pus aprèp la darrièra mesa a jorn: Anullar la mesa a jorn. La version del {older} s’aviarà a la reaviada que ven. Vòstres fichièrs e vòstras aplicacions son pas tocats."

msgid ""
"The version you're using now is the one before it with boot options changed in Wheelhouse.\n"
"\n"
"Undo the change: the computer starts with the boot options it had before, at your next restart. Automatic updates aren't paused.\n"
"\n"
"Or Cancel."
msgstr ""
"La version qu’utilizatz ara es la d’abans amb d’opcions d’aviada modificadas dins Wheelhouse.\n"
"\n"
"Anullar la modificacion: l’ordenador s’avia amb las opcions d’aviada qu’aviá abans, a la reaviada que ven. Las mesas a jorn automaticas son pas suspendudas.\n"
"\n"
"O Anullar."

msgid "The wallpaper changes to the next picture in a folder of yours."
msgstr "Lo rèireplan passa a l’imatge seguent d’un de vòstres dorsièrs."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The {fs} file system could not be loaded, so the disk can't be prepared."
msgstr ""
"Lo sistèma de fichièrs {fs} a pas pogut èsser cargat, doncas lo disc pòt pas "
"èsser preparat."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {label} is deleted."
msgstr "La {label} es suprimida."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {label} is not working."
msgstr "La {label} fonciona pas."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {label} is repaired."
msgstr "La {label} es reparada."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The {label} isn't working.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Repair the box. It rebuilds the box, puts your apps back, then installs {title}. Your files aren't touched."
msgstr ""
"La {label} fonciona pas.\n"
"\n"
"Recomandat: Reparar la bóstia. Reconstruís la bóstia, restablís vòstras aplicacions, puèi installa {title}. Vòstres fichièrs son pas tocats."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {name} ({unit})"
msgstr "Lo {name} ({unit})"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {name} graphics drive the screen."
msgstr "Lo grafisme {name} pilòta l’ecran."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {name} service ({unit})"
msgstr "Lo servici {name} ({unit})"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {title} download isn't signed by ArtCraft, so it was not installed."
msgstr ""
"Lo telecargament de {title} es pas signat per ArtCraft, doncas es pas estat "
"installat."

msgid "There are no app boxes to repair."
msgstr "I a pas cap de bóstia d’aplicacions de reparar."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "There is no start-up keyboard layout for {layout}."
msgstr "I a pas d’agençament de clavièr d’aviada per {layout}."

msgid ""
"There's no earlier version on this computer to go back to. Only the version "
"you're using now is kept."
msgstr ""
"I a pas de version mai anciana sus aqueste ordenador ont tornar. Sonque la "
"version qu’utilizatz ara es gardada."

msgid ""
"There's no earlier version to fall back to if putting the settings back "
"doesn't work, so the test doesn't run. Try it after the next update."
msgstr ""
"I a pas de version mai anciana de recors se lo restabliment dels paramètres "
"fonciona pas, doncas lo tèst s’executa pas. Ensajatz-lo aprèp la mesa a jorn "
"que ven."

msgid "These security certificates need attention. Pick one to see what to do."
msgstr ""
"Aquestes certificats de seguretat demandan vòstra atencion. Causissètz-ne un "
"per veire çò que cal far."

msgid "They open in Chrome."
msgstr "Se dobrisson dins Chrome."

msgid "They open in your usual browser. Choose to be asked about Chrome again."
msgstr ""
"Se dobrisson dins vòstre navigador abitual. Causissètz que vos siá tornamai "
"demandat per Chrome."

msgid "This account can't share folders."
msgstr "Aqueste compte pòt pas partejar de dorsièrs."

msgid ""
"This computer asks for the disk password every time it starts. The computer's security chip can unlock the disk instead.\n"
"\n"
"This needs the disk password, so it's one for your helper.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Set it up. Or Skip: it's in Wheelhouse any time."
msgstr ""
"Aqueste ordenador demanda lo senhal del disc a cada aviada. La puça de seguretat de l’ordenador pòt desverrolhar lo disc a la plaça.\n"
"\n"
"Aquò demanda lo senhal del disc, doncas es una tasca per la persona que vos ajuda.\n"
"\n"
"Recomandat: Lo configurar. O Passar: es dins Wheelhouse quand volètz."

msgid ""
"This computer can't go back by itself: it was installed before automatic "
"rollback was added, or automatic rollback was switched off. Computers "
"installed from a newer USB have it."
msgstr ""
"Aqueste ordenador pòt pas tornar en arrièr sol: es estat installat abans "
"l’apondon del retorn en arrièr automatic, o lo retorn en arrièr automatic es "
"estat desactivat. Los ordenadors installats a partir d’una clau USB mai "
"recenta l’an."

msgid ""
"This computer can't open its BIOS settings from here. Press the BIOS key "
"while it starts (often F2, F10, F12 or Delete)."
msgstr ""
"Aqueste ordenador pòt pas dobrir sos paramètres del BIOS d’aquí. Quichatz la "
"tòca del BIOS pendent l’aviada (sovent F2, F10, F12 o Supr)."

msgid ""
"This computer has no security chip (TPM) that can do this, so the disk "
"password stays."
msgstr ""
"Aqueste ordenador a pas de puça de seguretat (TPM) capabla de far aquò, "
"doncas lo senhal del disc demòra."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This computer is running a test copy ({name}) as its normal version, so a new test can't start from it.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Remove the test marker. The version without it starts at your next restart. Needs your password."
msgstr ""
"Aqueste ordenador executa una còpia de tèst ({name}) coma sa version normala, doncas un tèst novèl pòt pas començar a partir d’ela.\n"
"\n"
"Recomandat: Suprimir lo marcador de tèst. La version sens el s’aviarà a la reaviada que ven. Demanda vòstre senhal."

msgid ""
"This computer is running a test copy. Open Test automatic rollback again to "
"remove its marker."
msgstr ""
"Aqueste ordenador executa una còpia de tèst. Tornatz dobrir Testar lo retorn "
"en arrièr automatic per suprimir son marcador."

msgid "This computer started the USB stick in old BIOS (legacy) mode."
msgstr "Aqueste ordenador a aviat la clau USB en mòde BIOS ancian (legacy)."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This desktop uses {now}.\n"
"\n"
"Switch to {new}? It takes effect after you log out and back in.\n"
"\n"
"Or Keep it."
msgstr ""
"Aqueste burèu utiliza {now}.\n"
"\n"
"Passar a {new}? S’aplica aprèp vos èsser desconnectat e tornat connectar.\n"
"\n"
"O Gardar."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This file can't be installed. It may be damaged or not fully downloaded. Download it again and retry.\n"
"\n"
"(Details: {details})"
msgstr ""
"Aqueste fichièr se pòt pas installar. Pòt èsser damatjat o pas complètament telecargat. Telecargatz-lo tornamai e tornatz ensajar.\n"
"\n"
"(Detalhs: {details})"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This file is an older version of {title} than the one you have.\n"
"\n"
"Install the older version: replaces yours. Only do this if the newer one has a problem."
msgstr ""
"Aqueste fichièr es una version de {title} mai anciana que la qu’avètz.\n"
"\n"
"Installar la version mai anciana: remplaça la vòstra. Fasètz aquò sonque se la mai recenta a un problèma."

msgid ""
"This is a live session: it runs from the USB stick, nothing here is saved, "
"and the computer's disk isn't touched."
msgstr ""
"Es una session en dirècte: s’executa a partir de la clau USB, res es pas "
"enregistrat, e lo disc de l’ordenador es pas tocat."

msgid ""
"This is how the computer shows up on your network. Keep the suggestion, or "
"type a new one."
msgstr ""
"Es atal que l’ordenador apareis sus vòstra ret. Gardatz la suggestion, o "
"picatz-ne un novèl."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This is the 32-bit version of {title}, for older computers. Download the "
"64-bit version instead (often called amd64 or x86_64)."
msgstr ""
"Es la version 32 bits de {title}, pels ordenadors mai ancians. Telecargatz "
"puslèu la version 64 bits (sovent apelada amd64 o x86_64)."

msgid "This network"
msgstr "Aquesta ret"

msgid ""
"This removes things the computer no longer needs: unused app parts, old "
"system update files, and unused container images. Your files and your apps "
"aren't touched."
msgstr ""
"Aquò suprimís çò que l’ordenador a pas pus besonh: las parts d’aplicacions "
"inutilizadas, los ancians fichièrs de mesa a jorn del sistèma e los imatges "
"de contenidors inutilizats. Vòstres fichièrs e vòstras aplicacions son pas "
"tocats."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This saves the computer's recent error messages, its system version and the list of your apps to one file, {name}, in your Documents folder. What your apps showed or opened isn't in it.\n"
"\n"
"Then email that file to your helper. They can see what went wrong without being here.\n"
"\n"
"Nothing is sent anywhere by itself."
msgstr ""
"Aquò enregistra los messatges d’error recents de l’ordenador, sa version del sistèma e la lista de vòstras aplicacions dins un sol fichièr, {name}, dins vòstre dorsièr Documents. Çò que vòstras aplicacions an afichat o dobèrt i es pas.\n"
"\n"
"Puèi mandatz aqueste fichièr per corrièl a la persona que vos ajuda. Pòt veire çò qu’a mal virat sens èsser aquí.\n"
"\n"
"Res es pas mandat endacòm tot sol."

msgid ""
"This sets what other devices on this network can reach. Pick Public place "
"anywhere you're not sure. You can change it later in Wheelhouse, Network "
"safety."
msgstr ""
"Aquò definís çò que los autres aparelhs d’aquesta ret pòdon aténher. "
"Causissètz Luòc public pertot ont sètz pas segur. O podètz cambiar pus tard "
"dins Wheelhouse, Seguretat de la ret."

msgid ""
"This sets what you see at first. The next step suggests a desktop layout to "
"match, and the guide is in Wheelhouse, Get help, either way."
msgstr ""
"Aquò definís çò que vesètz d’en primièr. L’etapa seguenta suggerís una "
"disposicion del burèu adaptada, e la guida es dins Wheelhouse, Obténer "
"d’ajuda, dins totes los cases."

msgid "This setting is risky"
msgstr "Aqueste paramètre es riscat"

msgid "This start found these broken, as the test expects:"
msgstr "Aquesta aviada a trobat aquò avariat, coma lo tèst s’i espèra:"

msgid "This start found these still broken, as the test expects:"
msgstr "Aquesta aviada a trobat aquò encara avariat, coma lo tèst s’i espèra:"

msgid "This system's EFI partition: %s (disk %s, partition %s)"
msgstr "Particion EFI d’aqueste sistèma: %s (disc %s, particion %s)"

msgid "This takes a while."
msgstr "Aquò pren un pauc de temps."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "This version is from {when}."
msgstr "Aquesta version data del {when}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This {title} file is for a different kind of computer. Download the version "
"for this one (often called {names})."
msgstr ""
"Aqueste fichièr {title} es per un autre tipe d’ordenador. Telecargatz la "
"version per aqueste (sovent apelada {names})."

msgid ""
"Those are file sharing ports: folders are shared only on Home networks, in "
"Shared folders."
msgstr ""
