#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{name}: {steps}\n"
"\n"
"This really deletes these files from this computer: the user accounts and passwords (/etc/passwd, /etc/shadow, /etc/group, /etc/gshadow), the list of disks (/etc/fstab), the login rules (/etc/pam.d) and the administrator rules (/etc/sudoers). Your own files and apps aren't touched.\n"
"\n"
"Save your work and close your apps first: the computer restarts as soon as they're deleted.\n"
"\n"
"If putting them back doesn't work: when a start hangs or stays broken, hold the power button until the computer turns off, then turn it on. After 2 bad starts, the next start is the earlier version kept for Undo the last update, which has its own copy of these settings."
msgstr ""
"{name}: {steps}\n"
"\n"
"Aquò suprimís vertadièrament aquestes fichièrs d’aqueste ordenador: los comptes d’utilizaires e los senhals (/etc/passwd, /etc/shadow, /etc/group, /etc/gshadow), la lista dels discs (/etc/fstab), las règlas de connexion (/etc/pam.d) e las règlas d’administrator (/etc/sudoers). Vòstres pròpris fichièrs e aplicacions son pas tocats.\n"
"\n"
"Enregistratz vòstre trabalh e tampatz d’en primièr vòstras aplicacions: l’ordenador se reavia tanlèu que son suprimits.\n"
"\n"
"Se lo restabliment fonciona pas: quand una aviada se bloca o demòra avariada, tenètz quichat lo boton d’alimentacion fins que l’ordenador s’atude, puèi tornatz-lo alucar. Aprèp 2 marridas aviadas, l’aviada seguenta es la version mai anciana gardada per Anullar la darrièra mesa a jorn, qu’a sa pròpria còpia d’aquestes paramètres."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{name}: {steps}\n"
"\n"
"When it comes back, a message says the test worked, and the test copy is removed. Don't turn the computer off during the test unless the steps say to. {save}\n"
"\n"
"The test copy takes the place of the earlier version kept for Undo the last update, so Undo has nothing to go back to until the next update."
msgstr ""
"{name}: {steps}\n"
"\n"
"Quand torna, un messatge indica que lo tèst a foncionat, e la còpia de tèst es suprimida. Atudetz pas l’ordenador pendent lo tèst levat se las etapas o dison. {save}\n"
"\n"
"La còpia de tèst pren la plaça de la version mai anciana gardada per Anullar la darrièra mesa a jorn, doncas Anullar a pas res ont tornar fins a la mesa a jorn que ven."

